{"question_text": {"৪৯তম বিসিএস ⎯ গণিত (৫৫১)": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) Which is Gamma function or second Eulerian integral?<br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_XuPRSSg.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_tf4CPT9.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_SUFDDBu.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_pR1rxYZ.png\"><br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/25_TvKmm0b.PNG\" width=\"649\" height=\"89\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) What is the value of Γ(5)?<br>", "option1": "120<br>", "option2": "60<br>", "option3": "24<br>", "option4": "56<br>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>Since Γ(n + 1)= n! <br>So Γ(5) = Γ(4 + 1) = 4! = 4 . 3 . 2 . 1 = 24</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_88GbRPS.png\"><br>", "option1": "12<br>", "option2": "13<br>", "option3": "35<br>", "option4": "56<br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_uSs667D.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_RPWK0OO.png\"><br>", "option1": "110<br>", "option2": "123<br>", "option3": "145<br>", "option4": "120<br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_O