br>", "option1": "x<sup>2</sup>y” + xy’ + (x<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup>)y = 0<br>", "option2": "(1 - x<sup>2</sup>)y” - 2xy’ + n(n + 1)y = 0<br>", "option3": "y” - 2xy’ + 2ny = 0<br>", "option4": "xy” + (1 - x)y’ + ny = 0<br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>Bessel's equation: x<sup>2</sup>y” + xy’ + (x<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup>)y = 0  </p>\r\n<p>Legendre’s equation: (1 - x<sup>2</sup>)y” - 2xy’ + n(n + 1)y = 0 </p>\r\n<p>Hermite’s equation: y” - 2xy’ + 2ny = 0  </p>\r\n<p>Laguerre’s equation: xy” + (1 - x)y’ + ny = 0</p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) Which is Laguerre’s equation?<br>", "option1": "x<sup>2</sup>y” + xy’ + (x<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup>)y = 0<br>", "option2": "(1 - x<sup>2</sup>)y” - 2xy’ + n(n + 1)y = 0<br>", "option3": "y” - 2xy’ + 2ny = 0<br>", "option4": "xy” + (1 - x)y’ + ny = 0<br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>Bessel's equation: x<sup>2</sup>y” + xy’ + (x<sup>2</sup> - n<sup>2</sup>)y = 0</p>\r\n<p>Legendre’s equation: (1 - x<sup>2</sup>)y” - 2xy’ + n(n + 1)y = 0</p>\r\n<p>Hermite’s equation: y” - 2xy’ + 2ny = 0</p>\r\n<p>Laguerre’s equation: xy” + (1 - x)y’ + ny = 0</p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) What is the Rodrigue’s formula of Legendre polynomial?<br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_fX9Q7QO.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_wL4bmJE.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_ANG2vzK.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_pZLLxhv.png\"><br>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_7i8QT52.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "